        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "df844637-26ba-5067-a666-7e13b55a6f28",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bryan Brown, Paul McCartney, Ringo Starr, Peter Webb\n- Works: Give My Regards to Broad Street, Breaker Morant, F/X, Cocktail, Gorillas in the Mist, F/X2, Along Came Polly, Australia, Kill Me Three Times, Gods of Egypt\n- Topics: Bryan Brown filmography, film roles\n\nFacts:\n- Since the late 1970s, Bryan Brown has performed in over eighty film and television projects in Australia and abroad.\n- In 1980, Bryan Brown appeared in the film Breaker Morant.\n- In 1984, Give My Regards to Broad Street was released as a British musical drama film directed by Peter Webb and starring Paul McCartney, Bryan Brown, and Ringo Starr.\n- In 1986, Bryan Brown appeared in the film F/X.\n- In 1988, Bryan Brown appeared in the films Cocktail and Gorillas in the Mist.\n- In 1991, Bryan Brown appeared in the film F/X2.\n- In 2004, Bryan Brown appeared in the film Along Came Polly.\n- In 2008, Bryan Brown appeared in the film Australia.\n- In 2014, Bryan Brown appeared in the film Kill Me Three Times.\n- In 2016, Bryan Brown appeared in the film Gods of Egypt.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
